<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>オープンソースライセンス (Third Party Licenses) - Nanai Android Mascot</title>
    <style>
        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            body {
                background: #1e1e1e;
                color: #e0e0e0;
            }
            a {
                color: #4db8ff;
            }
            .license-text {
                background: #2d2d2d;
                border: 1px solid #444;
            }
        }
        body {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #333333;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .intro {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .licenses-overview {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .licenses-overview li {
            background-color: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.1);
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
        .licenses-list {
            list-style-type: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .license {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            padding-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .license:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .license-used-by {
            margin-top: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }
        .license-text {
            max-height: 250px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border: 1px solid #e9ecef;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
        }
        h3 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            padding-top: 60px; /* anchor offset */
            margin-top: -60px;
        }
        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            h3 { color: #8bb9ff; }
            .licenses-overview li { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }
            .license { border-bottom: 1px solid #444; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="container">
        <div class="intro">
            <h1>オープンソースライセンス<br><small>Third Party Licenses</small></h1>
            <p>Nanai Android Mascot (Rust Backend) は、以下の素晴らしいオープンソースソフトウェアを利用して構築されています。<br>
            各プロジェクトの開発者の皆様に感謝いたします。</p>
        </div>
    
        <h2>ライセンス一覧 (Overview):</h2>
        <ul class="licenses-overview">
            {{#each overview}}
            <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
            {{/each}}
        </ul>

        <h2>ライセンス詳細 (All License Texts):</h2>
        <ul class="licenses-list">
            {{#each licenses}}
            <li class="license">
                <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
                <p><strong>利用しているパッケージ (Used by):</strong></p>
                <ul class="license-used-by">
                    {{#each used_by}}
                    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{crate.name}} v{{crate.version}}</a></li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
                <pre class="license-text">{{text}}</pre>
            </li>
            {{/each}}
        </ul>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
